<title>USA: Dragon Environmental in acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Dragon Environmental in acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>SANFORD, Fla. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dragon Environmental Corp said Monday it is negotiating with an investment group interested in buying it for $3 to $4 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the proposal currently under discussion involves the Palm Beach, Fla.-based investment group buying Dragon shares on the open market.</p>
<p>Dragon stock was up 10/32 to 1-17/32 in Monday morning trading on the Nasdaq bulletin board.</p>
<p>The company said the negotiations should be completed within 90 days.</p>
</text>
